A 3 day jam full of vibes.

We have been throwing hip hop culture events for 10 years and recently added roller skating to the mix. \
Our festival consists of workshops, parties, graffiti jam, dance battles, markets, live PAs and this year thinking of doing a rhythmic ride by the beach ;-)
